    "description": "Postman tests for Mark all notifications as read. Endpoint: PATCH /api/notifications/mark-all-read/. Mock: not required (no external services - chỉ thao tác DB nội bộ, không gọi Firebase/SMS/Email/Stripe trong view này).",
